<title>USA: FSA qualifies West Fargo, N.D., for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies West Fargo, N.D., for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said on Monday that it qualified for bond insurance the following municipal issue scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--West Fargo, N.D., $1.5 million general obligations bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
